{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong> Play  Demo First! </strong>\u2728 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/899a731cefc94773b8a6cde54f07dda6.avif?t=1759768916\" alt=\"Sticker Shop Simulation\" width=1232 height=400 /></span>\ud83d\udc31Sticker Business is a cozy mix of shop simulator and creative design game. Design and print charming stickers, collect and organize rare finds, and manage customer orders to grow your little sticker empire! Open mystery boxes and watch out for the cute thief cat!  <br>  <br> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.poster.avif?t=1759768916\" aria-label=\"Sticker Game\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.webm?t=1759768916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.mp4?t=1759768916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a cozy top-down sticker shop, you design and print unique stickers to fill your shelves. Collect new designs from mystery boxes, organize them neatly, and prepare orders for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop tidy and your customers happy to grow your reputation and unlock upgrades. But watch out \u2014 there\u2019s also a cute thief cat sneaking around, trying to nab your rarest stickers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889280?t=1759768916","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/64e6bfc8f6a54d101dcdd4941dd107a0f3f3797d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759768916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/22bfd6ecc99a39651e6bd09db41815e8a15d6ce5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759768916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/22bfd6ecc99a39651e6bd09db41815e8a15d6ce5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759768916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<strong> Play  Demo First! </strong>\u2728 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/899a731cefc94773b8a6cde54f07dda6.avif?t=1759768916\" alt=\"Sticker Shop Simulation\" width=1232 height=400 /></span>\ud83d\udc31Sticker Business is a cozy mix of shop simulator and creative design game. Design and print charming stickers, collect and organize rare finds, and manage customer orders to grow your little sticker empire! Open mystery boxes and watch out for the cute thief cat!  <br>  <br> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.poster.avif?t=1759768916\" aria-label=\"Sticker Game\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.webm?t=1759768916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.mp4?t=1759768916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a cozy top-down sticker shop, you design and print unique stickers to fill your shelves. Collect new designs from mystery boxes, organize them neatly, and prepare orders for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shop tidy and your customers happy to grow your reputation and unlock upgrades. But watch out \u2014 there\u2019s also a cute thief cat sneaking around, trying to nab your rarest stickers!</p>","developers":["Bubito"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/06e0ccc8b8f565c28b0af6889287fca1bddfa6d1/header.jpg?t=1759768916","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3889280/1772377027/00491e66d5546a318825225836347b1a719a7c9b/1754702285/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754704826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3889280/1772377027/00491e66d5546a318825225836347b1a719a7c9b/1754702285/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754704826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3889280/1772377027/00491e66d5546a318825225836347b1a719a7c9b/1754702285/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754704826","id":257170550,"name":"Sticker Business","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170550/b73051c6afff9fe90b9e4d40b4c25b5a3878fe93/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754704826"}],"name":"Sticker Business","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium CPU G860<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 840M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linu